758	  /* ---- signature move: the hero plate's light pool wanders --------------
759	     Bespoke, page-authored: reads the hero act's own --sc-p (published by
760	     the engine on the [data-sc-act] element itself, per scroll/devices.md)
761	     and drives the <img>'s object-position between two crops of the same
762	     photograph — the pool appears to drift across the frame as the hero
763	     scrolls past. Never a kit device (data-sc-parallax etc. move the whole
764	     element; this moves what the element shows of itself). Frozen (object-
